<h3 id="sans-detection-engineering">五、SANS Detection Engineering 关键洞察</h3>
<blockquote>
<p>"Organizations recognize the critical role of detection engineering in combating sophisticated threats, and they're increasingly looking to AI and automation to enhance their capabilities."</p>
</blockquote>
<p><strong>检测工程最佳实践</strong>:<br />
1. <strong>持续验证SIEM规则</strong> — 确保AI驱动的SIEM能检测到重要威胁<br />
2. <strong>AI辅助攻击模拟</strong> — 使用真实数据测试威胁检测覆盖<br />
3. <strong>规则优化</strong> — 减少误报，提高检出率<br />
4. <strong>自动化工作流</strong> — 将检测、调查、响应串联</p>
<hr />
